    59	      01 SUBHEAD-1.
    60		  02 FILLER PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.    61            02 FILLER PIC X(7) VALUE "Student".                                   12DEC25 09:08:18  PAGE    2
    62		  02 FILLER PIC X(4) VALUE SPACES.
    63            02 FILLER PIC X(7) VALUE "Student".
    64		  02 FILLER PIC X(17) VALUE SPACES.
