    95	      01 DETALYE.
    96		  02 FILLER PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
    97		  02 P-SNO PIC 9(5).
    98		  02 FILLER PIC X(6) VALUE SPACES.
    99		  02 P-SNA PIC X(25).
   100		  02 PRT-QX OCCURS 5 TIMES.
   101		     03 PRT-QV PIC ZZ.
   102		     03 FILLER PIC X(5).
   103		  02 P-AVE PIC 99.99.
   104		  02 FILLER PIC X(15) VALUE SPACES.
